'''Dolphina''' (イルカ娘 ''Iruka Musume'', "'''Dolphin Daughter'''" or "'''Dolphin Girl'''") is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Legend Stages]] and [[The Aku Realms]]. She was added in [[Version 6.0 Update|Version 6.0]].

